    "tag": "About The Initiative",
    "title": "Transforming National Traffic Governance",
    "desc": "The E-Traffic SAAS platform is a government-backed initiative designed to modernize the enforcement, tracking, and settlement of traffic violations nationwide. By bridging the gap between field officers, administrative bodies, and citizens, we ensure absolute transparency and efficiency.",
